@startuml

!include fta_metamodel.puml

$FailureMode("shm-object created in wrong owner UID", "MemoryShared.CreateWithWrongCreatorUid")

$OrGate("Gate1", "MemoryShared.CreateWithWrongCreatorUid")
'We can't think of another reason, why the shm-object would be created with a wrong owner UID, than the creator process having a wrong UID. So we don't need to add another OR-Gate here.
$RootCause("shm-object creation API did mess up creator UID", "MemoryShared.ShmObjectCreateAPIBroken", "Gate1")

@enduml




@enduml